# The PrismPM revision `prismpm build` and `prismpm verify` of the gateway are made by
# in .github/workflows/lexlean.yml, and the only place it is written (AGENTS.md R1), like
# .github/lexlean.rev. The workflow builds `prismpm` at this commit with `vendor/lexlean`
# replaced by the LexLean of .github/lexlean.rev, so one pin drives both tools, as in
# UOR-Foundation/MCP#37 (.github/lexlean-ci/lib.sh, `install_prismpm`).
#
# Development imports upstream commits; a release pins only upstream releases. This pin
# moves to the PrismPM SDK release that contains PrismPM#216 before lexlean-mcp v0.1.0.
#
# Currently: PrismPM main at the merge of #572, with the whole server application of #216
# (#561, #564, #570) and the per-request methods of the generated host (#429), which the
# gateway's telemetry implements (#16).
